-- title:
--   Exact finite contour guard packet1, cells128 through255
-- statement:
--   128 ordinary records with necessary proved finite arithmetic fields: lower/upper norm-square guards for proposed jets, a rational disc-margin guard, endpoint-ratio guard, exact128-bit ratio and16-term rounded logarithm values. Every field is checked by the ordinary Lean kernel. These records assert only finite properties of proposed data, with no analytic value enclosure, nonvanishing, winding, zero count or RH conclusion.
-- source:
--   Platt Fourier polynomial DOI10.1090/mcom/3198 and finite Taylor/logarithm arithmetic. Attribution sometik179 c9908072-d99a-4431-aad8-a72c6352619a and Gabewhigham.

